    <dashboardType>SpecifiedUser</dashboardType>
    <description>2021 Solution &amp; Scale dashboard - Near Real Time KPI reports:  Key scale partners identified in SFDC PARTNER Field.  For Network/Visual Cloud uses cases, set Solution Detail dashboard filter. Vertical Market identifies account types (e.g. CommSP)</description>
